# MOVEMENT III — TRIO, G major, 3/4, same tempo. ||: b45-60 :||: b61-80 :||
# then Menuetto D.C. al Fine (Scherzo WITHOUT repeats, ends b44).
# A Ländler: the CELL turned major (g g b | a g f# | g - d | b) sung by
# cl1 with fg1 two octaves below; hn12 G-drones; vc/cb pizz on the beat,
# vn2/va after-beats. Part 2: horn call on D echoed by fl/ob, vn1 sings
# the CELL in E minor (the only shadow), cl/fg lead back, return.
# Trumpets, hn34 tacet (Bb basso horns cannot play in G major).

== b45-60 [D] TRIO ==
@ K=GM "Trio" repeat=b45-60
cl1:  | 4 {p}{dolce} [g4 g4 b4 | 4 a4 g4 f#4] | 2 [g4 4 d5 | 2. b4] | 4 [c5 c5 e5 | 4 d5 c5 b4] | 2 [c5 4 a4 | 2. d5] | 4 [b4 b4 d5 | 4 c5 b4 a4] | 4 [b4 g4 d5 | 2. e5] | 4 [d5 b4 g4 | 4 a4 c5 f#4] | 2. g4 | 4 g4 r r |
fg1:  =cl1 -16
hn12: | 2. {pp} (g3 d4) | % | % | % | % | % | 2. (d4 a4) | % | 2. (g3 d4) | 2. (d4 a4) | 2. (g3 d4) | % | % | 2. (d4 a4) | 2. (g3 d4) | 4 (g3 d4) r r |
fl1:  | R*7 | 4 {pp} r a5' f#5' | R*7 | 4 r d6' c6' |
vn2:  | 4 {p} r (b3 d4) (b3 d4) | r (a3 c4) (a3 c4) | r (b3 d4) (b3 d4) | r (b3 d4) (b3 d4) | r (c4 e4) (c4 e4) | r (b3 d4) (b3 d4) | r (c4 f#4) (c4 f#4) | r (a3 d4) (a3 d4) | r (b3 d4) (b3 d4) | r (a3 c4) (a3 c4) | r (b3 d4) (b3 d4) | r (c4 e4) (c4 e4) | r (b3 d4) (b3 d4) | r (a3 c4) (a3 c4) | r (b3 d4) (b3 d4) | r r r |
va:   | 4 {p} r g3 g3 | r f#3 f#3 | r g3 g3 | r g3 g3 | r g3 g3 | r g3 g3 | r a3 a3 | r f#3 f#3 | r g3 g3 | r f#3 f#3 | r g3 g3 | r g3 g3 | r g3 g3 | r f#3 f#3 | r g3 g3 | r r r |
vc:   | 4 {pizz}{p} g2 r r | d3 r r | g2 r r | b2 r r | c3 r r | g2 r r | a2 r r | d3 r r | g2 r r | d3 r r | b2 r r | c3 r r | d3 r r | d2 r r | g2 r r | g2 r r |
