== b61-80 [E] ==
@ repeat=b61-80
hn12: | 4 {p} d4' d4' g4' | 2 a4 4 d4 | R*2 | R*4 | 2. {pp} g3 | 2. (g3 d4) | 2. (d4 a4) | % | 2. (g3 d4) | % | % | % | % | 2. (d4 a4) | 2. (g3 d4) | 4 (g3 d4) r r |
