@ "Menuetto da capo al Fine, senza replica" (play b1-44 without repeats; end at b44)

HANDOFF:
  next_bar: Mvt IV b1   key: G minor   meter: 2/2 (alla breve)
  tempo: Presto, h = 112   dynamics: ff (motto)
  At the seam: Mvt III ends at b44 after the D.C.: tutti ff G-minor
  stroke on beat 1 (bass g2/g1, vn1 four-note chord g4-d5-bb5-g6,
  horns and trumpets on g, timp g2), beats 2-3 silent.  Horns stay in
  G (hn12) and Bb basso (hn34); tp in G; timp g2/d3.  Strings arco.
  NEXT: Mvt IV motto b1-8: the whole orchestra hurls the CELL in 8ths
  (g3 g3 bb3 a3 g3 f#3 g3 d3) ff unison, answered by a G-minor chord
  stroke; then P (02-themes no.7) p in vn1 at b9 over a pulsing bass.
